{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10133020","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10133020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1013302001:0":{"text":"테미히아는 정말 대단해요. 제가 처음 갑옷을 입었을 땐 서 있기만 해도 숨이 턱턱 막혔는데 말이죠...","source_cn":"特弥希娅比我厉害，我刚刚开始穿着重甲的时候，只是站着都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C4CE90CC4F85D2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013302002:0":{"text":"물론 지금은 입은 사실조차 깜빡하고 잠들기도 할 정도로 익숙해졌지만요. 하하하.","source_cn":"不过，现在也习惯了。偶尔还会忘记脱掉睡觉呢。嘿嘿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD056098AA11B3F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013302003:0":{"text":"웃으면서 그렇게 무서운 소리를 하다니, 정말 이해할 수가 없군요. 성당에는 전부 이상한 사람들만 모인 건 아닌지...","source_cn":"搞不懂。居然在笑着说这种可怕的事，你们圣堂的人是不是都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4075DF21254A805","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013302004:0":{"text":"엥? 잠깐. 테미히아, 지금 웃은 거죠? 친해져야 당신의 그런 표정도 볼 수 있는 거였군요.","source_cn":"咦，等等，特弥希娅在笑？原来混熟之后，你也会露出这种表情啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12D7EBDCAF41D5F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013302005:0":{"text":"...무슨 문제라도 있나요? 저기, 앞쪽에 있는 영지가 저희의 목적지인 것 같네요.","source_cn":"……有什么问题吗？请看，前方那片营地，应该就是我们的目...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5876C983B37ACBA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013302006:0":{"text":"맞아요. 바로 저기예요. 제가 먼저 가서 사람들과 인사를 나누고 있을게요!","source_cn":"没错，就是前面的营地，我先去跟大家打个招呼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A4F74525218D606","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"루시우스","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"테미히아","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:菲":{"text":"페이","source":"菲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":4}}